(LEGAL-002 - OPERATIVE CLAUSES & STATUTORY DIRECTIVES \(PAGE 2\)) Tj T*
(Title: Tamil Nadu Protection of Tanks and Eviction of Encroachment Rules, 2007 \(G.) Tj T*
(Addressed / Competent Officer: Assistant Executive Engineer \(WRD Sub-Division\) & Revenue Tahsildar) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 1: Rule 3 & Rule 4 \(Forms I, II, III\)) Tj T*
(Rule 3 requires preparation of the Register of Tanks in Form-I verified jointly by) Tj T*
(the Revenue Tahsildar and WRD Assistant Engineer. Rule 4 stipulates that public) Tj T*
(notice of tank boundaries shall be published in Form-II in the village chavadi and) Tj T*
(Panchayat office, followed by individual eviction notice in Form-III.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 2: Rule 6 \(Recovery of Eviction Cost\)) Tj T*
(Rule 6 provides that all expenses incurred by the Water Resources Department in) Tj T*
(demolishing unauthorised buildings, walls, or infilling inside the water spread) Tj T*
(area shall be recovered from the encroacher as arrears of land revenue.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
